Description: Lightweight SEO audit SDK and CLI for SEOWebChecker
 A lightweight open-source client SDK and CLI tool for full website SEO
 audits, Core Web Vitals checks, and on-page optimization powered by
 SEOWebChecker (https://seowebchecker.com/).
 .
 Features include:
  * Full on-page SEO audit (title, meta, headings, images, links)
  * Core Web Vitals check via Google PageSpeed Insights
  * Structured JSON output for CI/CD pipelines
  * Command-line tool: seowebchecker-audit

Package: seowebchecker
Architecture: all
Depends:
 python3-seowebchecker (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: SEO audit CLI tool for SEOWebChecker (metapackage)
 This metapackage installs the seowebchecker-audit command-line tool.
 .
 Run a full SEO audit of any website using SEOWebChecker's API:
   seowebchecker-audit --url https://seowebchecker.com/
